=== two-batch role structure (controlled vs breadth), not a confound ===
var   = pre-registered CONTROLLED first batch (base_clock 1.7GHz, turbo-off, energy-comparable): 25 tags
wave2 = BREADTH-extension second batch (dynamic turbo-on, energy descriptive-only): 70 tags
overlap: 0 models  ->  disjoint batches by design
energy is confined to the controlled var batch BY DESIGN; quality/det are
regime-invariant so the full 94-functional quality ranking is valid.

